WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:10.271
Video 8. Stock: unit, group, godown, ane HSN
ane GST rate saathe stock items.

00:00:10.471 --> 00:00:14.390
Stock item maate unit ane stock group joie.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.541
Godown batave chhe ke stock kya chhe.

00:00:17.471 --> 00:00:26.903
Item potano HSN code ane GST rate raakhe chhe.
Stock Summary ma darek item dekhay chhe.

00:00:27.203 --> 00:00:33.225
C dabavo to List of Masters khule chhe.
Inventory masters vachche chhe.

00:00:33.255 --> 00:00:41.292
"unit" lakho, ane Enter dabavo. Type Simple
chhe. Symbol Mtr, etle metres.

00:00:41.991 --> 00:00:49.167
GST maate, Unit Quantity Code MTR-METERS.
Pachhi 2 decimal places.

00:00:49.197 --> 00:00:53.315
Hisaab puchhe chhe: Accept? Yes maate Y.

00:00:54.395 --> 00:00:58.728
Esc, C, ane Stock Group maate "stock gr"
lakho.

00:00:59.428 --> 00:01:05.472
Group Fabrics chhe, Primary niche. Ctrl+A thi
save thay chhe.

00:01:05.502 --> 00:01:11.984
Pachhi godown: Ring Road Warehouse. Godown
etle jya tame stock raakho chho.

00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:14.116
Ctrl+A.

00:01:15.727 --> 00:01:17.390
Have stock item.

00:01:19.153 --> 00:01:22.452
Cotton Fabric, Fabrics niche, metres ma.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:34.201
Opening stock: 500 metres, ₹120 na bhaave, Ring Road
Warehouse ma. Hisaab ₹60,000 gane chhe.

00:01:34.231 --> 00:01:41.043
GST maate, HSN code 5208, ane GST rate: 5%.

00:01:42.948 --> 00:01:46.556
Ctrl+A thi item save thay chhe.

00:01:46.586 --> 00:01:57.211
Biji item Silk Fabric chhe: 200 metres, ₹450
na bhaave, HSN 5007, ane e pan 5%.

00:01:58.963 --> 00:02:04.181
Esc, pachhi S: Stock Summary. Fabrics: 700
metres.

00:02:04.211 --> 00:02:10.564
Enter dabavo to darek item ena quantity, rate
ane value saathe dekhay chhe.

00:02:11.044 --> 00:02:14.277
Opening stock ni kimat ₹1,50,000 chhe.

00:02:14.207 --> 00:02:17.498
Emaathi Silk Fabric ₹90,000 chhe.

00:02:17.699 --> 00:02:23.915
Tamaro stock taiyaar chhe. Have pachhi: GST
saathe sales invoice.

